<title>USA: Rick's Cabaret Q2 net profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Rick's Cabaret Q2 net profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months ended March 31</p>
<p>							   1997	  1996</p>
<p> Net Revenue				   $1,960,642  $1,200,883</p>
<p> Operating income (loss)			 83,796   (138,332)</p>
<p> Net income (loss)				 41,975    (91,180)</p>
<p> Earnings (loss) per common share		0.01	(0.03)</p>
<p> Weighted avg shrs outstanding	    4,120,922   3,640,000</p>
<p>Notes: Full company name is Rick's Cabaret International Inc. The company said it has incurred a net loss of $673,964 or $0.15 per share for the fiscal year to date after a restatement and change in the method of accounting for preopening costs in Q1 vs a six-month net loss a year ago of $83,792 or $0.02 per share. The restatement and accounting procedures changes did not affect Q2 figures, the company said.</p>
</text>
